  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 3002.03 “Betting ticket” means a physical or electronic document containing a unique identification code representing a wager that was placed, received and accepted by a betting system operated by an agent, and authorized by the commission.\n\nSource. #13041, eff 5-9-20",
